If $C$ is a valid upper bound for the total corruption then active arm elimination with $\wid(a) = \sqrt{ rac{\log\prn*{
icefrac{2KT}{\delta}}}{n(a)}}+ rac{C}{n(a)}$ has regret $ igO\prn*{\sum_{a 
eq a^\star}\prn*{ rac{\log\prn*{
icefrac{KT}{\delta}}+C}{\Delta(a)}}}$ with probability $1-\delta$.

Algorithm ef{alg:agnostic} which is agnostic to the coruption level $C$, when run with widths ... has regret: $$ igO\prn*{\sum_{a
eq a^*} rac{K\cdot C\log\prn*{
icefrac{KT}{\delta}}+\log\prn*{T}}{\Delta(a)}\cdot\log\prn*{
icefrac{KT}{\delta}}}.$$

Algorithm ef{alg:agnostic} which is agnostic to the corruptions $C(a)=\sum_t |r^t(a)-r_{\s}^t(a)|$, when run with widths ... has regret: $$ igO\prn*{\sum_{a
eq a^*} rac{K\cdot \max\prn*{C(a^{\star}),C(a)}\cdot\log\prn*{
icefrac{KT}{\delta}}+\log\prn*{T}}{\Delta(a)}\cdot\log\prn*{
icefrac{KT}{\delta}}}.$$
